    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/0ecfa041eca677cc528646dd7e188199.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deep within the dry, vast plain</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lives a creature strange and wild,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For by day, he\u2019s just a cat,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>By night, a human, undefiled.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And with his gang in the canga\u00e7o,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They fight with tooth and claw compiled.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/abde3ca79200f736e7465f0068994eff.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/8882b90cbe99d36f5e23cf380364c806.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was fine\u2026 until she appeared.\u00a0<strong>Seven-Skin</strong> \u2014 an ancient, powerful being \u2014 fell for L\u00eddia and tried to take her away. But as the leader of the gang, L\u00eddia rejected her heart. Hurt and scorned, Seven-Skin cast a terrible curse: she unleashed countless creatures upon the land \u2014 monsters, half-beast, half-apparition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/790dc38e4fbef91ba630cc4114a40e9c.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/29cea1d5007799d2a95090805675fe82.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect the gang, the blesser intervened. But when it came to the cat, she gave him a boons unlike any other:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/dd83261aa97e759a32a8687342188041.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=513 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/a6b1bb9c540c03e532c9a25dbe6e1083.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The two possess their powers,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But fate keeps them apart.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When the cat grows weak,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The man finds strength to start.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And when their roles reverse,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It leaves them both in the dark. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/eb78fc7bd1c8dfae1145f0207abc8ad3.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/60578a3e9fda27474a6950881710b6f5.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>A Cat in the Canga\u00e7o</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>roguelike</strong> with <strong>deckbuilding</strong> and <strong>auto-battle</strong> mechanics, set in the sun-scorched Brazilian Northeast. The art draws from <strong>xylography</strong> (woodcut prints), and the story takes inspiration from <i>cordel</i> literature. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/62a9b2673881c9aabbad9c9b8c071e2c.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-and-Night Mechanics</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you play as the Cat. By night, as Guto. Use your cards to strengthen one form, while weakening the other. The key lies in balancing your choices to create powerful builds for both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and combine cards that alter the game with upgrades, curses, and unique events. Some cards feature verses of <i>cordel</i>, narrating your adventure and crafting a personalized story at the end of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergy Modifiers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and experiment with synergies between cards and items to create powerful combos. Every run presents new opportunities to maximize your builds\u2019 potential.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planning and Roguelike Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each defeat, return stronger for the next attempt. Invest resources with the Blesser, improving your stats for future runs. Every visit to her offers a chance to refine your strategy and push further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic decisions shape the unfolding narrative. At each stage, you build your own story, immortalized in a unique <i>cordel</i> poem at the game\u2019s conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rhythms of <i>xote</i>, <i>forr\u00f3</i>, <i>bai\u00e3o</i>, and other Northeastern Brazilian styles accompany every run.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xylography - Woodcut-Inspired Art</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Unique style directly influenced by the folk art of Northeastern Brazilian.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/0ecfa041eca677cc528646dd7e188199.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deep within the dry, vast plain</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lives a creature strange and wild,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For by day, he\u2019s just a cat,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>By night, a human, undefiled.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And with his gang in the canga\u00e7o,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They fight with tooth and claw compiled.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/abde3ca79200f736e7465f0068994eff.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=289 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/8882b90cbe99d36f5e23cf380364c806.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was fine\u2026 until she appeared.\u00a0<strong>Seven-Skin</strong> \u2014 an ancient, powerful being \u2014 fell for L\u00eddia and tried to take her away. But as the leader of the gang, L\u00eddia rejected her heart. Hurt and scorned, Seven-Skin cast a terrible curse: she unleashed countless creatures upon the land \u2014 monsters, half-beast, half-apparition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780630/extras/790dc38e4fbef91ba630cc4114a40e9c.avif?t=1755394368\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 